{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/225635-senshi-the-merchandising-20th-anniversary-edition-fan-project","id":225635,"title":"Senshi: The Merchandising 20th Anniversary Edition (Fan Project)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-11T21:37:38-07:00","id":225635,"title":"Senshi: The Merchandising 20th Anniversary Edition (Fan Project)","content":"Okay, I am a fan of the humorous fan game <i>Senshi: The Merchandising, </i>a fan-made Classic World of Darkness gameline invented by one John Biles way back in the late 90's/early 2000's that focuses on 90's anime, <i>Sailor Moon</i> in particular. I did not invent this fan game and everything contained within belongs to CCP and the various anime companies as well. In other words, I own nothing and make no money off of this project.<br /> <br /> Although it is intended as a lighthearted parody, I consider it part of my personal World of Darkness canon and I wish to update it from Revised to 20th Anniversary (which mechanically speaking, should not be much work), and I wish to take all available material from the website that hosts the rules and update it. So far, there's only three books (or more accurately, old webpages that contain the setting and rules), and they are <i>Senshi: The Merchandising, Cliquebook: Sailor Warriors, Cliquebook: Magical Knights of Arcadia,</i> and that's really it. So comprising material shouldn't be too hard, even if you add your own custom materials as well.<br /> <br /> This thread is sort of my workshop for developing and fine-tuning S20, where I can refine my ideas and post new ones as well.<br /> <br /> I want to include all the cliques (equivalent to clans or tribes) and add three new cliques of my own, each with their own clique merit and clique weakness. One of them is from a 2000's anime (to go with the 90's anime stuff from the main game), and the other two are from Western Media. Here's what I got on my list of to-dos for S20.<br /> <br /> <b>All the powers and merchandise from the original Senshi: The Merchandising, plus some new things as well</b><br /> <b>All the original cliques, plus three new ones!<br /> More background info and ways to make this game work within the 20th Anniversary setting of Classic World of Darkness<br /> New enemies to battle!<br /> Guidelines for Live-Action play<br /> New merits and flaws to go with the old ones<br /> New Credos<br /> In-depth guidelines for both Canon Senshi and Otaku (i.e. Fan-Made) Senshi</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Here's all the cliques from the original that may need some minor updating, as well as the three new cliques, highlighted in italics.<br /> <br /> The Sailor Warriors (Sailor Moon)<br /> The Espers and Miracle Girls (KOR, Miracle Girls)<br /> The Wedding Warriors (Wedding Peach)<br /> The Tuxedos/Guardians (Sailor Moon)<br /> The Idol Angels (Creamy Mami, Fancy Lala)<br /> The Holy Thieves (Mysterious Saint Tail)<br /> The Fairy Princesses (Minki Momo)<br /> The Card Captors (Cardcaptor Sakura)<br /> The Magical Knights of Arcadia (Magic Knight Rayearth)<br /> The Good Witches and Warlocks (Mahou Tsukai Tai, Azukin Chacha)<br /> <i>The Jutsu Ninjas (Naruto)<br /> The Space Marines (Warhammer 40,000)<br /> The Wrestling Superstars (WWE, TNA, WCW, ECW)</i><br /> <br /> <br /> So, is anyone else interested in helping me develop this fan project?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T04:47:13-07:00","id":225830,"title":"","content":"Can't say I can help (after all, I haven't still readed the the first edition of the game and I got some language problem), but I'm interested.<br /> <br /> Contemplated the idea of the &quot;Armored Knights (Saint Seiya, Samurai Troopers)&quot; ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T12:18:44-07:00","id":226192,"title":"","content":"Stardust Crusaders / Speedwagon's Foundation (Jojo's Bizarre Adventure), anyone?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T13:20:12-07:00","id":226271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/225635-senshi-the-merchandising-20th-anniversary-edition-fan-project?p=226192#post226192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Stardust Crusaders / Speedwagon's Foundation (Jojo's Bizarre Adventure), anyone?</div> </div> </div> </div>If I knew more about Jojo's Bizzare Adventure, I would definitely add it to the game. I'll try and watch it if I can and add it to the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T15:47:18-07:00","id":226466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If I knew more about Jojo's Bizzare Adventure, I would definitely add it to the game. I'll try and watch it if I can and add it to the game. </div> </div> </div>I can always try to write expansion splat when I get time, since that's most familiar Japanese setting I am familiar with (Nasuverse is the second), and I already roughly have vision how to simulate certain powers (Hamon simply as dealing aggro to vampires with martial arts, Stands as expanded equivalent of Manifested Avatars, but with more narrows and specific powers than Spheres of Awakened Magic, Stone Mask Vampires certainly can simply use certain Disciplines that are already in OWoD, Cyborgs can use stuff already established in M20 and W20).<br /> <br /> Pillar Men would be more tricky since they are only 4 survivors in the series, cannot breed anymore since all women of their species died and pretty much they are unique powerful NPCs unless I bring back their race through a retcon. To put it shortly, Pillar Men, namely Santana, Wham, AC/DC and Cars are humanoid species that are not undead but are vampiric in nature. Allergic to sunlight (which puts them temporarily into stasis instead of killing), absorb living matter through their cells to feed (created Stone Mask vampires just because normal humans don't sustain them as effectively) and their powers stem from perfect control over every single cell in their organism.<br /> <br /> Pretty much covered many stuff mechanically unless the splat drastically diverges form OWoD.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T17:27:52-07:00","id":226621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/225635-senshi-the-merchandising-20th-anniversary-edition-fan-project?p=226466#post226466\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can always try to write expansion splat when I get time, since that's most familiar Japanese setting I am familiar with (Nasuverse is the second), and I already roughly have vision how to simulate certain powers (Hamon simply as dealing aggro to vampires with martial arts, Stands as expanded equivalent of Manifested Avatars, but with more narrows and specific powers than Spheres of Awakened Magic, Stone Mask Vampires certainly can simply use certain Disciplines that are already in OWoD, Cyborgs can use stuff already established in M20 and W20).<br /> <br /> Pillar Men would be more tricky since they are only 4 survivors in the series, cannot breed anymore since all women of their species died and pretty much they are unique powerful NPCs unless I bring back their race through a retcon. To put it shortly, Pillar Men, namely Santana, Wham, AC/DC and Cars are humanoid species that are not undead but are vampiric in nature. Allergic to sunlight (which puts them temporarily into stasis instead of killing), absorb living matter through their cells to feed (created Stone Mask vampires just because normal humans don't sustain them as effectively) and their powers stem from perfect control over every single cell in their organism.<br /> <br /> Pretty much covered many stuff mechanically unless the splat drastically diverges form OWoD.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be appreciated, basically all I need for the splat is a merit and a weakness inherent in the clique (Senshi's version of clans or tribes), and some new powers for said clique. I'm sure you can help me with that. Thank you for helping me on this.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T18:04:19-07:00","id":226648,"title":"","content":"Okay, I'm not sure I will be immediately available due to two research papers I have to submit, but I will do my best to get over with important work quickly, within reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T18:49:30-07:00","id":226691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/225635-senshi-the-merchandising-20th-anniversary-edition-fan-project?p=226648#post226648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, I'm not sure I will be immediately available due to two research papers I have to submit, but I will do my best to get over with important work quickly, within reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you, that sounds awesome. Good luck on your research papers!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}